SUMMARY:Sound Bath & Gong Meditation w David Heiss @ Santuary Studio
DESCRIPTION:Star Sounds Asheville\nJoin in for a relaxing sound bath medit
 ation led by David Heiss\, Long time gong player and sound healing musicia
 n. David has been playing gongs and facilitating sound healing journeys si
 nce 2012.\n\nLeave the week's stress behind as you relax and reset your ne
 rvous system with this special clearing crystal gong bath.\n**We will begi
 n with a brief overview of the current astrology in the sky Including what
  Venus Retrograde is all about\,** Then enjoy a powerful yet relaxing 45 m
 in. gong meditation followed by an integration.\n\nReserve your spot here:
  [Star Sounds](https://www.starsounds.love/event-details/sound-bath-gong-m
 editation-w-david-heiss-santuary-studio-3)\n\n🔱**Neptune is almost stil
 l evening as the heavenly planet stations direct. This occurrence happens 
 once\, sometimes twice a year. When Neptune is still...the divine messages
  can be heard easier. Venus is back in Scorpio and has just about retraced
  her shadow bringing new light to love and attraction as her and Mars are 
 dancing together in harmony. Just allow the vibration of the Gongs to move
  through you**🔱\n\nReserve your spot here: [Star Sounds](https://www.st
 arsounds.love/event-details/sound-bath-gong-meditation-w-david-heiss-santu
 ary-studio-3)\n\nWhen the gong sings\, you listen. You listen listens with
  every cell of your body. You hear it and feel it. You begin to sense more
 . The obscure sounds leave your brain guessing and eventually surrenders t
 o the soundwave as you begin to relax\, feel and heal. The vibrational fre
 quencies can awaken stagnant energy. The experience is like a personal dre
 am. There are moments during a gong meditation where the subconscious can 
 become more conscious\, where illumination and insight follows.\n\n**Sugge
 sted donations for this event are $20-40**. Donations can be made at the e
 vent via cash or Venmo **@starsounds**\nIf you like to donate early reserv
 ing your spot\, you can Reserve your spot here: [Star Sounds](https://www.
 starsounds.love/event-details/sound-bath-gong-meditation-w-david-heiss-san
 tuary-studio-3) also using Venmo **@starsounds** here but not required.\nW
 alk-ins are welcome as a 1st arrive basis. Cash at the door is fine. There
  is plenty of room\, sometimes it will max out. If you want your spot guar
 anteed\, come about 15 min early **or** pre-pay Venmo **@starsounds**\n**Y
 ou can RSVP here** [Star Sounds](Reserve your spot here: Star Sounds)\n\n*
 *We provide some pads and blankets. You are welcome to bring your own comf
 ort items. You are also able to sit in our chairs if you prefer that suppo
 rt.**\n\nThe entrance is located at the very center of the shopping center
  in Woodfin. \\* downstairs \\*\n\n* The event is from 6:00 pm to 7:30 pm\
 n\n### 🔊 **The Experience**\n\nAs the gong waves move through you:\n\n*
  The nervous system begins to **downshift and unwind**\n* The mind softens
 \, releasing control\n* The body opens into **deep cellular resonance**\n*
  Stagnant energy begins to **move\, release\, and reorganize**\n* This tim
 e we are fresh off a full moon in Aquarius and the energies are still stro
 ng\n\nMany describe the experience as entering a **dreamlike\, timeless st
 ate**—\nwhere insight\, emotion\, and clarity arise naturally from withi
 n.\nThe sound doesn’t guide you somewhere else…\n**it brings you deepe
 r into yourself.**\n\n### 🌌 **Why This Now**\n\n2026 is not a passive y
 ear—it is revolutionary- an evolutionary leap is here now.\nWe are being
  asked to **trust ourselves at a deeper level**\, to move without certaint
 y\, and to listen inward more than ever before.\nSound—especially the go
 ng—has a unique ability to **bypass the thinking mind** and reconnect yo
 u with your own internal guidance system.\nThis journey is an opportunity 
 to:\n\n* Reset your energetic field\n* Reconnect with your intuition\n* Re
 align with your inner rhythm\n* Sudden insight and clarity\n\n### 🌀 **W
 hat is Sound Healing?**\n\nSound healing works through **vibrational reson
 ance**.\nThe rich\, non-linear overtones of instruments like the gong inte
 ract directly with the body’s energetic and physical systems—supportin
 g:\n\n* Relaxation and nervous system regulation\n* Emotional release\n* E
 nergetic clearing and activation\n* Expanded states of awareness\n\nYou do
 n’t need to “do” anything—\nsimply **lie down\, receive\, and allo
 w**.\n\n### 🧘 **What to Bring**\n\nYoga mat • Blanket • Pillow • 
 Water • Anything for comfort\n\n*\n\n```\n**About David**\nDavid Heiss s
 pecializes in Self-Discovery using sound alchemy though blending unique so
 unds with instruments including many gongs\, crystal bowls\, and other abs
 tract sounding pieces that create a abstract symphony of sound overtones t
 o create a healing restorative experience. Being an Evolutionary Astrologe
 r\, he offers natal chart readings to assist in your self-discovery proces
 s as he has personal experience in the success of these divine arts in his
  own healing process. He has been working with stars and sounds\, AKA Gong
 s and Astrology since 2012. His intention is to create a space through sou
 nd to help you realize more of who you are.\n```\n\n*\n\n```\nDavid discov
 ered the healing vibration of Gongs in 2012 after a powerful spontaneous K
 undalini Awakening and has ever since been drawn to Self-Discovery by Know
 ing Thy-Self. Convinced that the stars are inside of us\, he uses sound an
 d evolutionary astrology to discover who we are and why we are here findin
 g our souls purpose on earth. Since 2015\, David has dedicated his life to
  Self-Discovery using astrology and sound alchemy though blending unique s
 ounds with instruments including many gongs\, crystal bowls\, and other ab
 stract sounding pieces creating a abstract symphony of sound overtones to 
 create a healing restorative experience.\n```
