SUMMARY:🎅🎄⛄Holly Jolly Cacao-W-H-E-E⛄🎄🎅
DESCRIPTION:Star Sounds Asheville\nOnce the Saturday night parade conclude
 s and the busy weekend of shopping\, storefront window gazing\, and light 
 displays winds down\, join us for an intimate Sunday sanctuary. **Holly Jo
 lly Cacao-W-H-E-E** is your space to relax\, breathe\, and anchor the beau
 tiful spirit of the holiday season into your heart—not just for December
 \, but for the entire year ahead.\n🍫 **The Sacred Ceremony: Cacao & Sou
 nd**\nWe will begin by gathering in a circle to share a warm\, heart-openi
 ng cup of ceremonial-grade cacao. Cacao acts as a gentle catalyst\, helpin
 g us drop from our analytical minds and ground deeply into our heart cente
 rs. As the medicine of the cacao settles\, you will be bathed in a deeply 
 restorative sound healing journey. Let the soothing vibrations of sacred i
 nstruments wash away the weekend's exhaustion\, calming your nervous syste
 m and bringing you into a state of blissful relaxation.\n\n🪐 **The Astr
 ology: Meeting the Cosmic Santa Claus**\nDuring this event\, we will dive 
 into a fascinating cosmic exploration: **The Astrology of Jupiter**.\nDid 
 you know that Saint Nicholas and the modern Santa Claus are the ultimate h
 uman personifications of the planet Jupiter? Known in astrology as the "Gr
 eat Benefic\," Jupiter is the planet of generosity\, abundance\, luck\, an
 d expansion. Because this event falls on Saint Nicholas Day\, we are gathe
 ring under the perfect cosmic alignment to tap into the archetype of Fathe
 r Christmas himself.\nTogether\, we will explore the striking parallels be
 tween Saint Nick and Jupiterian energy:\n\n* **The Archetype of Generosity
 :** How Jupiter acts as the cosmic Santa Claus\, expanding our lives and b
 estowing unexpected blessings and divine grace.\n* **"Jovial" Jollity:** D
 iscovering how the hearty\, cheerful\, "Ho\, Ho\, Ho" energy of Santa stem
 s directly from Jove (Jupiter) and how we can cultivate that warmth year-r
 ound.\n* **The Divine Judge:** Understanding Jupiter’s connection to tru
 th and justice (checking the "naughty or nice" list) and how aligning with
  integrity brings good fortune.\n* **Overcoming Boundaries:** Mirroring ho
 w Santa slides down chimneys to deliver gifts\, we will learn how Jupiter 
 helps us bypass limitations and expand beyond our comfort zones.\n\n✨ An
 chor the Light\nThe true magic of the holidays shouldn't fade when the dec
 orations come down. This evening is designed to help you consciously ancho
 r the high-vibrational\, generous\, and joyful frequency of Jupiter within
  your spirit. Walk away feeling profoundly relaxed\, cosmically aligned\, 
 and ready to carry the true "holly jolly" spirit with you into the new yea
 r.\n\nReserve you spot here: [HollyJolly](https://www.starsounds.love/even
 t-details/holly-jolly-cacao-w-h-e-e)\n\n**🙏Donations Start at $33 up to
  $55 Please give what you can to guarantee your spot. If $33 is to much\, 
 just email David at [david@starsounds.love](mailto:david@starsounds.love) 
 for a special price🙏**\nIf you prefer to make it spontaneous\, you are 
 welcome to show up and we will fill remaining spots on a first-come basis.
  See you there\n\nReserve you spot here: [HollyJolly](https://www.starsoun
 ds.love/event-details/holly-jolly-cacao-w-h-e-e)\nCan also Vemno @starsoun
 ds\n\n### **About Your Guides**\n\n**David Heiss** is an Evolutionary Astr
 ologer\, Sound Alchemist & Sacred Ceremony Facilitator who specializes in 
 Self-Discovery. He helps reveal each person’s unique collection of stars
  and sound using a variety of insightful chart readings\, sound journeys\,
  fire ceremonies\, and immersive experiences. David blends Gongs\, Crystal
  and Tibetan bowls\, plus many other mystical instruments to cultivate con
 ditions for healing and restoration. [https://www.starsounds.love/](https:
 //www.starsounds.love/)\n\n**Michelle** is an avid SoulCollage® Creatrix 
 and lifelong educator who knows we are a network of connected humans. Mich
 elle delights in nurturing and expanding ideas\, people\, and communities 
 that are lighting up the world with their precious energy. She works with 
 individual’s HighSelves\, offering a wide range of tools and experiences
 \, to facilitate self-reflection and access to inner wisdom. Learn more [w
 ww.autumnhair.net](http://www.autumnhair.net).
